  "text_summary": "The non-monotonic dip at alpha=0.60 is consistent across all available seeds: both seed=42 (v4) and seed=43 yield 0/8 PermG detections and consensus_ge3=0, confirming the anomaly is not a single-seed artifact. A sigmoid fit excluding alpha=0.60 yields alpha_c=0.765, k=5.7, R\u00b2=0.2856, predicting P(det)=0.282 at alpha=0.60\u2014substantially above the observed 0.000. Including the alpha=0.60 point degrades the fit (alpha_c=0.823, k=5.6, R\u00b2=0.2047; \u0394R\u00b2=0.0809), confirming it is a genuine outlier relative to the monotonic sigmoid trend. The version change from K>=3=3/8 to 0/8 reflects re-running seed=42 with corrected d120 recompilation data (v4), which strengthened rather than weakened the anomaly."
